WEBVTT

NOTE Visual descriptions; separate from the background-music caption.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Opening card: From the Ground Up. A Custom Home Build.

00:02.000 --> 00:03.033
Excavated building site with foundation forms. Label: Excavation.

00:03.033 --> 00:04.267
White foundation forms around the footprint. Label: Foundation.

00:04.267 --> 00:05.533
Taller white wall forms with openings. Label: ICF Walls.

00:05.533 --> 00:06.767
Framed walls and stacked building materials. Label: Framing.

00:06.767 --> 00:08.033
Two-story wall framing with a large lower-level opening. Label: Second Floor.

00:08.033 --> 00:09.267
Exterior sheathing covers the structure. Label: Sheathing.

00:09.267 --> 00:10.533
Wrapped exterior and exposed roof framing. Label: Weatherproofing.

00:10.533 --> 00:11.767
Dark siding appears on the main walls. Label: Metal Siding.

00:11.767 --> 00:13.033
Close view of siding, roof and remaining wrap. Label: Roofing.

00:13.033 --> 00:14.267
Finished front with glazing, balcony and lower stonework. Label: Complete.

00:14.267 --> 00:15.833
Wider rear and side views of the finished house.

00:15.833 --> 00:17.367
Wide views of the house and small steep-roofed outbuilding.

00:17.367 --> 00:18.933
Close view of the outbuilding with roof-mounted solar panels.

00:18.933 --> 00:20.700
Wide property view with house, outbuilding, grass and wooded hillside. Closing-card transition begins.

00:20.700 --> 00:23.466
Closing card: Built by Kiefer. Custom Homes · Colorado. kbuiltco.com.

